[[Tantras]] used this spell on [[Zhalia Moon]] upon discovering her role as a [[Huntik Foundation]] spy. It forced her to drop her [[Logosbook]] which Tantras proceeded to pick up and read. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell at the [[Blood Spiral Base]] during a violent training session with a [[Silent Soldier]]. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}

Harrison used the spell during his final battle with his brother [[Den Fears]]. It gave his [[Antedeluvian|Powerbonded Antedeluvian]] an opportunity to defeat Den's [[Cursed Archer]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

